   1:./Libraries/src/misc.c **** /**
   2:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * @file    misc.c
   4:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * @version V1.8.0
   6:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * @date    04-November-2016
   7:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * @brief   This file provides all the miscellaneous firmware functions (add-on
   8:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *          to CMSIS functions).
   9:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *          
  10:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *  @verbatim   
  11:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                               
  12:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *          ===================================================================      
  13:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                        How to configure Interrupts using driver 
  14:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *          ===================================================================      
  15:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * 
  16:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *            This section provide functions allowing to configure the NVIC interrupts (IRQ).
  17:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *            The Cortex-M4 exceptions are managed by CMSIS functions.
  18:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *
  19:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *            1. Configure the NVIC Priority Grouping using NVIC_PriorityGroupConfig()
  20:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                function according to the following table.
  21:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****  
  22:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *  The table below gives the allowed values of the pre-emption priority and subpriority according
  23:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *  to the Priority Grouping configuration performed by NVIC_PriorityGroupConfig function
  24:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *    ============================================================================================
  25:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *      NVIC_PriorityGroup   | NVIC_IRQChannelPreemptionPriority | NVIC_IRQChannelSubPriority  |  
  26:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *    ============================================================================================
  27:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *     NVIC_PriorityGroup_0  |                0                  |            0-15             | 0
  28:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                           |                                   |                             | 4
  29:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ARM GAS  /tmp/cct8rX4c.s 			page 2


  30:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *     NVIC_PriorityGroup_1  |                0-1                |            0-7              | 1
  31:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                           |                                   |                             | 3
  32:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  33:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *     NVIC_PriorityGroup_2  |                0-3                |            0-3              | 2
  34:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                           |                                   |                             | 2
  35:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  36:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *     NVIC_PriorityGroup_3  |                0-7                |            0-1              | 3
  37:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                           |                                   |                             | 1
  38:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  39:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *     NVIC_PriorityGroup_4  |                0-15               |            0                | 4
  40:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *                           |                                   |                             | 0
  41:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *    ============================================================================================
  42:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *
  43:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *            2. Enable and Configure the priority of the selected IRQ Channels using NVIC_Init() 
  44:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *
  45:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * @note  When the NVIC_PriorityGroup_0 is selected, IRQ pre-emption is no more possible. 
  46:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *        The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the subpriority.
  47:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *
  48:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   * @note  IRQ priority order (sorted by highest to lowest priority):
  49:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *         - Lowest pre-emption priority
  50:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *         - Lowest subpriority
  51:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *         - Lowest hardware priority (IRQ number)
  52:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *
  53:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *  @endverbatim
  54:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   *
  55:./Libraries/src/misc.c ****   ******************************************************************************
